        <h1>Introduction</h1>
<p>This documentation aims to provide all the information you need to work with our API.</p>
<aside>As you scroll, you'll see code examples for working with the API in different programming languages in the dark area to the right (or as part of the content on mobile).
You can switch the language used with the tabs at the top right (or from the nav menu at the top left on mobile).</aside>
<blockquote>
<p>Base URL</p>
</blockquote>
<pre><code class="language-yaml">http://localhost</code></pre><h1>Authenticating requests</h1>
<p>This API is authenticated by sending an <strong><code>Authorization</code></strong> header with the value <strong><code>"Bearer {YOUR_AUTH_KEY}"</code></strong>.</p>
<p>All authenticated endpoints are marked with a <code>requires authentication</code> badge in the documentation below.</p>
<p>You can retrieve your token by visiting your dashboard and clicking <b>Generate API token</b>.</p><h1>Absence</h1>
<h2>Listing des absences</h2>
<p><small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small></p>
<blockquote>
<p>Example request:</p>
</blockquote>
<pre><code class="language-bash">curl -X POST \
    "http://localhost/api/absencesall" \
    -H "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_AUTH_KEY}" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -H "Accept: application/json" \
    -d '{"idSchool":8,"idSection":8,"idTeacher":10,"idStudent":9,"type":{},"idClasse":10,"date":{},"filter_value":{}}'
</code></pre>
<pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost/api/absencesall"
);

let headers = {
    "Authorization": "Bearer {YOUR_AUTH_KEY}",
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Accept": "application/json",
};

let body = {
    "idSchool": 8,
    "idSection": 8,
    "idTeacher": 10,
    "idStudent": 9,
    "type": {},
    "idClasse": 10,
    "date": {},
    "filter_value": {}
}

fetch(url, {
    method: "POST",
    headers,
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
}).then(response =&gt; response.json());</code></pre>
<pre><code class="language-php">
$client = new \GuzzleHttp\Client();
$response = $client-&gt;post(
    'http://localhost/api/absencesall',
    [
        'headers' =&gt; [
            'Authorization' =&gt; 'Bearer {YOUR_AUTH_KEY}',
            'Accept' =&gt; 'application/json',
        ],
        'json' =&gt; [
            'idSchool' =&gt; 8,
            'idSection' =&gt; 8,
            'idTeacher' =&gt; 10,
            'idStudent' =&gt; 9,
            'type' =&gt; [],
            'idClasse' =&gt; 10,
            'date' =&gt; [],
            'filter_value' =&gt; [],
        ],
    ]
);
$body = $response-&gt;getBody();
print_r(json_decode((string) $body));</code></pre>
<blockquote>
<p>Example response (401):</p>
</blockquote>
<pre><code class="language-json">{
    "message": "Unauthenticated."
}</code></pre>
