<h2>Récupère la liste paginée des retards scolaires.</h2>
<p><small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small></p>
<p>Permet de filtrer par idStudent, idCourse, date, hour.
La pagination est configurable via <code>pageItems</code> (page actuelle) et <code>nbreItems</code> (nombre d'éléments par page).</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Example request:</p>
</blockquote>
<pre><code class="language-bash">curl -X POST \
    "http://localhost/api/school-delaysall" \
    -H "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_AUTH_KEY}" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -H "Accept: application/json" \
    -d '{"filter_value":"dolor","nbreItems":1,"pageItems":14,"idClasse":2,"idStudent":7,"idCourse":4,"date":"2025-11-22T14:46:54+0000","hour":"14:46"}'
</code></pre>
